","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=119818\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=119818\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker222","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=18658\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=18658\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker223","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=148669\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=148669\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker224","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=133626\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=133626\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker225","name":"Baluut Monster","legend":"Whispers say a relic monster of 8 m long inhabits Baluut Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker226","name":"Ishahrmabad Monster","legend":"Elders say a relic monster of 17 m long inhabits Ishahrmabad Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker227","name":"Cragport Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 25 m long."},{"id":"marker228","name":"Dogrove Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 36 m long."},{"id":"marker229","name":"Dawngview Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 37 m long."},{"id":"marker230","name":"Amburn Warg","legend":"Rumors speak of a hungry Warg who inhabits Amburn hills and steals cattle at night."},{"id":"marker231","name":"Onarvueurvorly Dragon","legend":"Tales speak of a big Dragon who inhabits Onarvueurvorly hills and keeps the region at bay."},{"id":"marker232","name":"Fll'ylialora Roc","legend":"Whispers speak of a prime Roc who inhabits Fll'ylialora hills and keeps the region at bay."},{"id":"marker233","name":"Tsakhanmonkh Hag","legend":"Rumors speak of a feared Hag who inhabits Tsakhanmonkh hills and abducts young women."},{"id":"marker234","name":"Laywasinf Vampire","legend":"Journeying folk speak of a fat Vampire who inhabits Laywasinf hills and snatches people from homes."},{"id":"marker235","name":"Nightmouth Cyclops","legend":"Legends speak of a horrifying Cyclops who inhabits Nightmouth hills and attacks unsuspecting victims."},{"id":"marker236","name":"Gramney Banshee","legend":"Elders speak of a horrifying Banshee who inhabits Gramney hills and snatches people from homes."},{"id":"marker237","name":"Lingan Ogre","legend":"Whispers speak of a great Ogre who inhabits Lingan hills and snatches people from homes."},{"id":"marker238","name":"Midpass Hag","legend":"Elders speak of a terrifying Hag who inhabits Midpass hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker239","name":"Arsu Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Xian Ti Druidism."},{"id":"marker240","name":"Imourza Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Kesmarch Pantheon."},{"id":"marker241","name":"Waldb Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Kesmarch Pantheon."},{"id":"marker242","name":"Ewhoemu Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Thurigypt Spirits."},{"id":"marker243","name":"Haton Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Coven of the Emerald Jaguar."},{"id":"marker244","name":"Liversk Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Novallumism."},{"id":"marker245","name":"Schrafengen Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Kesmarch Pantheon."},{"id":"marker246","name":"Enasarionnoc Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Blasphemy of the Dead Python."},{"id":"marker247","name":"Ovoovi Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Novallumism."},{"id":"marker248","name":"Bayanbuir Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Novallumism."},{"id":"marker249","name":"Zhaowulin Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Novallumism."},{"id":"marker250","name":"Sarauroth Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Novallumism."},{"id":"marker251","name":"Changxia Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Thurigypt Spirits."},{"id":"marker252","name":"Torksey Crows","legend":"A gang of mounted bandits."},{"id":"marker253","name":"Mashantu Boars","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker254","name":"Gaharukthel Hares","legend":"A gang of angry highwaymen."},{"id":"marker255","name":"Portsbury Beavers","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker256","name":"Murzai Hyenas","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker257","name":"Tsadaatsatad Wolfs","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker258","name":"Nustan Bisons","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker259","name":"Mamengambo Rooks","legend":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"id":"marker260","name":"Ormskirk Sharks","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker261","name":"Darleighes Bears","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker262","name":"Luniavesk Owls","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker263","name":"Kursk Falcons","legend":"A gang of highlander highwaymen."},{"id":"marker264","name":"Gortenburg Lions","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker265","name":"Tizawt Leopards","legend":"A gang of mounted bandits."},{"id":"marker266","name":"Kwawanyak Spiders","legend":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"id":"marker267","name":"Tongchuan Rooks","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker268","name":"Inzheim Badgers","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker269","name":"Hovisey Falcons","legend":"A gang of mounted bandits."},{"id":"marker270","name":"Seafordgere Spiders","legend":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"id":"marker271","name":"Buluunkhulun Ravens","legend":"A gang of mounted bandits."},{"id":"marker272","name":"Rouvraibelle Panthers","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker273","name":"Bunzad Scorpions","legend":"A gang of angry brigands."},{"id":"marker274","name":"Bobkimer Tigers","legend":"A gang of mounted highwaymen."},{"id":"marker275","name":"Metersford Rooks","legend":"A gang of mounted bandits."},{"id":"marker276","name":"Shunia Tigers","legend":"A gang of highlander brigands."},{"id":"marker277","name":"Shar Foxes","legend":"A gang of angry bandits."},{"id":"marker278","name":"Widetonter Rats","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker279","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker280","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker281","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker282","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker283","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker284","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker285","name":"Quzhounyi Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc0f\udc31\ud802𐠑\udc1f𐠃\udc22\ud802\ud802𐠴𐠂\ud802\ud802𐠥\ud802\ud802𐠿\udc34\udc08𐠚\udc0b\ud802\ud802𐠢\udc21𐠧\udc01𐠈\udc3f\udc18\ud802𐠄𐠞𐠼𐠟𐠲𐠑\udc23\udc0d\udc04\udc0e\udc23\udc13\udc1c\udc10𐠋\udc32\udc3c\ud802𐠛\udc13 𐠓\udc10\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠁𐠅\udc31\udc1c\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker286","name":"Aymockwar Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡭᡕᡆᠿᠭᠡᢥᢐᡕᠰᠪᠮᠾ᠑ᢑᡮᡕᢒᢁᢑᠳᢂᠱᢡᠱ᠑ᢥᢐᢢᡕᢀᢋᠩᢑᠦᢒᢒᠡᡗᢑᡠᠱᡔᡳᢦ᠑ᠱ᠀᠐ᡀᢏᡲᡟᡔᢒ</div>"},{"id":"marker287","name":"Coldfair Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሀከፈተደወነፐጸተዐ ጸጰገሀዐፀወቀ  ረሀጠፀአጸፐቀ ሠፐጠደሠፐሐገደሀፀፈሀበበሀ ሰረገለሐሀ የደበሀሀከጠጰቀጸጰሰፐወለገ ሐሠሠፐሠተ ረ መ  ዘአ</div>"},{"id":"marker288","name":"Houndhill Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፐፐጰሠጠዐደኀፀገቀፀሠጰአአመዐአ መፀበአቀ በዘረጸአበፀረገፀተሰሰፐ ፀኀዐአመ</div>"},{"id":"marker289","name":"Mackington Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc27\ud802𐠯𐠤\udc2f𐠟\ud802\ud802𐠐\udc2c\udc31𐠄\udc27\udc34\udc31\udc37\udc24\ud802\ud802 𐠐\ud802𐠍𐠩\ud802𐠬\udc2a𐠎\ud802𐠂\udc16\udc38\udc23\ud802𐠡\udc27𐠎𐠘\udc26\udc28𐠊𐠅\udc0d\udc0c</div>"},{"id":"marker290","name":"Eguard Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠳᠨᡟᠦᠿᠲᠡᡖᢁᢠᡭᡀᠦᢤᡁᠳᡕᡖᢛᠳᡰᢥᢦᡕ᠒ᠪᡑᡗᠾᡓᡁᢢᡆᡟᡆᢐᡎᢀᡏᠿᡒᠽᠻᡒᡲᢀᠧᡱᡗᢑᢑᢡᢒᡱᡖᡐᡏᠯᠦᢠᠩᢀᢐᢋᠾᡆᡡᡴᡳᢋ᠐ᢢᢂᢑᡎᡕ᠑ᠵᡡᡮᠧᠨᡞ</div>"},{"id":"marker291","name":"Wivexe Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⲷ⳧ⲶⳈⳁⳠⳭⳭⲲ⳧ⲶⳈⲸ⳥ⲲⳀⳐ⳧⳹ⳆⳤⳂⲾⳠⳫⳀⲲⳃ⳹ⳚⳊⳫⳲⲴⳜⳀⳲⳃⳤⲲⳬⳐⳫⳒ</div>"},{"id":"marker292","name":"Pforzgrade Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">᠀ᢞᡡᢠᡝᠰᡡᡏᡠᡭᡲᠨᡕᢏ᠐ᡎᢒᡟᠦᡑᡳᠮᡓᡀᡎᠽᢥᠲᠲᢏᡏᢁ᠀ᢏ᠐ᡀᢜᠮᡍᢠᢤᢡᠵ᠐ᢥᢑᡝᡠᡙᡏᡴᢡᠡ᠐</div>"},{"id":"marker293","name":"Idelight Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡑᢀᡴᠱᡝᡱᡳᠾᠪᠯᢠᢤᡰᢡᠲᠩᠡᢏᠱᢑᡗᡰᡰᠲᢦᡳᠡᠻᢟᢤᠻᢁᠰᡗ᠑ᡑᡴᢀᡁᡏ᠀ᠮᡱᢥᡑᠨᡕᢂᢁᠭᡮᡭᠧᢥᢂᡲᡀᠪᡖᡱ᠐᠀ᠧ</div>"},{"id":"marker294","name":"Shisov Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡟ᠀ᠰᡭᠽᠪᡓᢞᢥ᠀ᡏᠵᢐᠠᠡᢋᠯᠠᡑᡍᢡᢥᠳᢤᢋᡱᡠᠼᠪᢐᠲᠠᡴᠾᠧᠯᡔᡡ᠐ᡰᢤᠽᡙᢤᢥᢏᢒᡝᠲᡮᢦᠯᠳ᠀ᠼ᠑ᢒᡯᡲᡖᢦᢒᢤᢐᡠᠻᠲᠳᢋᡔᢏᢢᡲᠾᠳᡒᡲ᠀ᢁᡍᢀᡕᢒᠭᠦᡞᠻᡖᢏᠻᡑᢦᡖᡓ</div>"},{"id":"marker295","name":"Lolafsf Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc31\udc34𐠞\udc3c\udc14\udc13\ud802\ud802𐠸\udc04\udc15\udc3f𐠼\ud802𐠬𐠮\udc0a𐠴\ud802\ud802 \udc1c\udc19 \ud802\ud802𐠨\ud802𐠏\udc05\udc13\udc11\ud802𐠗\udc04𐠝\ud802\ud802𐠢\ud802𐠠\udc2d\udc37\udc20\udc0e𐠚𐠷𐠑\udc11\udc2d\udc02\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker296","name":"Norranagnacu Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳹ⲾⲾⳬⳜⳃⲲⳬⳈⳂⳢⳁⳃⳒⲸⲸⳢ⳹ⲲⳂⳭⳫⲾⳞⳫⳞⲸⳁⳭⳖⳞⳜⳬⳒⳬⲴⳒⲲ ⳜⳆⳆⳈⳲ⳾ⳂⲾⳭⳒⳲ</div>"},{"id":"marker297","name":"Quatle Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༓༜༐༅༴༠༲༛༿༮༑༑༬༢༔༦༸༚༣༄༂༺༩༾༰༹་༡༃༐༈༭༆༚༲༌༲༭༽༐༙༖༔༖༲༼༹༪༈༱༹༆༾༰༠༵༾༰༴༭༯༫༭༷༜ༀ༔༅༑༻༪༚༤༣༡༿</div>"},{"id":"marker298","name":"Calcesfield Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠒\ud802 \udc16\udc31𐠰\udc01\ud802𐠂\udc12 \udc0b\udc32\udc19\udc30𐠑𐠘𐠂\ud802𐠷\udc29\udc2f\udc1e\udc25\udc0d\udc30\ud802\ud802𐠂\udc0d𐠅\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker299","name":"Amarissos Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠊\udc2f\udc2c \udc33\udc23\udc23\udc2e\udc26\ud802𐠷\udc22𐠃\ud802𐠓𐠵\udc17\udc04\udc25\ud802𐠱\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠘𐠄\udc14\udc31\ud802\ud802𐠅\udc3c\udc30\udc26\udc02\udc0f𐠈\udc23\ud802\ud802𐠿\ud802𐠤\ud802𐠐\udc2f\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠷\udc35\udc1e\udc15\udc0c𐠬\udc1b\udc21\ud802\ud802 \udc15\udc11𐠭\udc13\udc21𐠷</div>"},{"id":"marker300","name":"Steisede Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳒⲴⳃⳎⳃⲸⳊⳞⳲⲲⲺⳆⲶⲾ ⳊⳤⳠⳲⳔⲴⳜⲸⳭⳖ⳪ⲶⲺ⳪ⲸⳔ⳥ⳠⳚ⳩ Ⳉ⳧⳧ⲺⲶⳚⳈ⳾ⲸⳆ ⳀⲶ⳾ⳠⳠⳘ ⳒⳜ ⳪Ⳓ ⳎⳖ⳩ⲺⲼⳔⲺⳬⳃⳌⲶⳘⳞⲶ⳩⳪ⳆⲺⲺⳁⳢⳤⳎⳬⳔⲼ⳹Ⲹ</div>"},{"id":"marker301","name":"Lostdate Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༠༹༆༥༨༊༔༮༲༛༄༓༵༷༬༪༮་༑༯༚༃༺༁༃༼༁༠༒༦༜༨༉༤༣༃༐༓༷༣༓༒༱༨༿༜༼༆༯༨༻༺༴༐༨</div>"},{"id":"marker302","name":"Utirsa Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳾ⲶⲼ⳥ⳀⳔⳃⲲⳎ ⳧ⳢⳎⳎⳚⳫⳀⳃⲼⳂⲼⳢ⳹⳥ ⳥⳥ⳒⳘⳌ ⳆⳖⳃⳁⳄⳀⳖⳃⳲⳠ ⳪</div>"},{"id":"marker303","name":"Mdiq Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡑᡀᡒᢞᡔᢠ᠐ᢦᡞᡰᠧᠧᡰᢜᡍᠧᡰᠼᠳᠽᢀᡓᡓᡴᡯᠿᢢᡗᢂᡓᢓᢤᢑᢀᢑᢢᡱᡒᠻᠭᡱᢑᡳᢞᠮᢂᡲᡟᡒᠭᢀᡙᠯᢟᡝᢠ᠐ᢛᠯᡯᢢᠦᢥᡓᡡᠧᡜᢦᡮᠱᠡᠻᢑᢡᡭᡖᡕᠭᡍᠡᡒᡙᢂᡐᡜᠿᠵ</div>"},{"id":"marker304","name":"Mosshorest Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳬ⳧ⳁⲼⳬⲶⳁⳄⳭⳫⳭⳠⲴⳂⳲⲺⳢⳎ⳹Ⳓ ⳘⲲⲾⲶⳃⳆⳲⳒⳬⳀ⳥ⲼⳂ⳧ⳭⲾⲶⳖ⳪Ⳛ ⳧⳥Ⲵ ⳄⲸⲸⳂⳘ⳥ⲺⲼⳆ ⳹ⳔⲶ⳹⳧</div>"},{"id":"marker305","name":"Faymouth Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༐༡༓༡ༀ༈༣༁༛༂༽༽༦༊༵༷༫༑༉༙༌༈༖༑༛༪༑༜༫༪༇༈༬